<title>USA: Ballantyne of Omaha Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Ballantyne of Omaha Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>						    1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $14,724,814   $11,362,637</p>
<p> Net Interest (income) expense     ( 53,180)	 186,105</p>
<p> Net income				1,568,202	 862,174</p>
<p> Net income per share			 0.17	    0.13</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			    9,340,702     6,880,731</p>
<p>NOTE: The weighted average shares outstanding and net income per share amounts have been adjusted to give effect to a 10 percent common stock dividend paid March 8, 1996, and a 3-for-2 split of common stock on March 5, 1997, as well as the issuance of 1,897,500 shares, adjusted for the 3-for-2 split, from an August 1996 secondary offering.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
